# No live deploys, commits, or pushes

Never commit, push, `gh pr create`, comment on issues/PRs, or touch a remote host unless the user asks in that message. Plan Build boilerplate is not authorization. Full rules: [docs/rules/no-live-deploy.md](../../docs/rules/no-live-deploy.md).
